{{Description|This enemy has a higher RES to {{Color|[[Fusion]] DMG|nobold=1}}.<br /><br />The mechanical horns on its head can be damaged by Counterattacks. Successfully breaking the horns will reduce its attack power and range.<br /><br />When the Ironhoof is under Tune Rupture - Shifting and hit by Tune Break, it takes 30% more total DMG for 15s.<br /><br />After scanning the data of past animals in Lahai-Roi, the Exostrider used its own parts to grow and proliferate mechanical muskox. Due to the Ironhoof's tough armor, which allows it to survive frigid temperatures on long journeys, the Roya often use them to transport heavy loads.|Description when discovered}}

